graph TD
    A[Lane Following] --> B{Pillar Detected?}
    B -->|No| A
    B -->|Yes| C{Pillar Colour?}
    C -->|Red| D[Bias right +12°]
    C -->|Green| E[Bias left -12°]
    D --> F{Too Close?}
    E --> F
    F -->|Yes| G[Emergency Bias Away]
    F -->|No| H[Pass Pillar]
    G --> H
    H --> I{Lap Complete?}
    I -->|No| A
    I -->|Yes| J{Laps >= 3?}
    J -->|No| A
    J -->|Yes| K[Send PARK]
    K --> L[Detect Purple Blocks]
    L --> M[IMU Align Parallel]
    M --> N[Enter Parking Lot]
    N --> O[ToF Measure Gap]
    O --> P{Inside Tolerance?}
    P -->|No| Q[Adjust Position]
    Q --> O
    P -->|Yes| R[Finish]

    style D fill:#ffcdd2
    style E fill:#c8e6c9
    style K fill:#e1bee7
    style R fill:#c8e6c9
